                    \\,.
          .num_remark
            %h6#remark_3 Remark
            %p
              This statement also follows from the general theory of
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/excisive+functors"} excisive functors
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Charles+Rezk"} Charles Rezk
              %em
                %a{:href => "n-excisive+%28?%2C1%29-functor#nExcisiveApproximation"} n-Excisive functor – Properties – n-Excisive reflection
              for the above fact and its generalization to “
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Goodwillie+calculus"} Goodwillie
              = succeed "\u201D." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/jet+bundles"} jet bundles
          .num_remark
            %h6#remark_4 Remark
            %p
              We may think of the tangent
